    "final_text": "To determine which services are exposed externally via LoadBalancer or NodePort, I will list all services in the cluster and check their `type` field. Services of type `LoadBalancer` or `NodePort` are externally accessible.\n\nINVESTIGATION_PLAN:\n- Fetch all services across all namespaces to identify their types.\n- Filter for services with type `LoadBalancer` or `NodePort`.\n\nFetching the data now.The following services are exposed externally via `NodePort`:\n\n1. **Namespace:** `mohsen`\n   - **Name:** `fancy-website`\n   - **Type:** `NodePort`\n   - **Cluster-IP:** `10.96.67.96`\n   - **Port(s):** `80:31234/TCP`\n\n2. **Namespace:** `mohsen`\n   - **Name:** `fancy-website-service`\n   - **Type:** `NodePort`\n   - **Cluster-IP:** `10.96.41.170`\n   - **Port(s):** `80:30855/TCP`\n\n3. **Namespace:** `mohsen`\n   - **Name:** `web-app-service`\n   - **Type:** `NodePort`\n   - **Cluster-IP:** `10.96.77.67`\n   - **Port(s):** `80:30546/TCP`\n\nNo services of type `LoadBalancer` are currently configured in the cluster.",
